Key points:
- Uses Polars' lazy expressions so the sum expression is built dynamically from lst0.
- Casts each column to Float64 and treats nulls as 0.0 (so nulls don't produce row-level nulls in the sum).
- Returns a new DataFrame with the additional column var0.
