- The function takes an explicit agg_col (the column to aggregate). If you want to aggregate multiple columns simultaneously, adjust the code to accept multiple agg columns and handle the resulting 2D shape.
- Group keys are stringified to produce valid column names. If two different keys stringify to the same name, a later one will overwrite the earlier column (you may want to guard against this in your caller).
