/// Compares two sequences and returns a boolean sequence indicating whether
/// elements at each index refer to the same object instance (by pointer equality).
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `seq1` - First sequence of references
/// * `seq2` - Second sequence of references
///
/// # Returns
