- ✅ Generic over any cloneable type `T`
- ✅ Uses iterators for functional style (modern Rust)
- ✅ Includes assertions for safety
- ✅ Clear documentation with examples
- ✅ Works with Rust 2024 edition

## Complexity

- **Time**: O(n log n) due to sorting
- **Space**: O(n) for the indexed vector

