- Finally, any columns of df0 not mentioned in var0 are appended in their original df0 order.

This uses the Polars Rust crate (a maintained, modern DataFrame library). Add this dependency to your Cargo.toml:
- polars = "0.34"  (adjust to a current 2024+ release as appropriate)

