/// Groups a DataFrame by a specified column and returns the row with the maximum value
/// in another specified column for each group.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `df` - The input DataFrame containing the data
/// * `group_by_col` - The column name to group by
/// * `value_col` - The column name to find the maximum value in
///
/// # Returns
/// A Result containing the grouped DataFrame with the maximum rows for each group
///
