Key notes:
- For each numeric column we compute mean and std using a single-pass Welford algorithm (robust, avoids extra allocations).
- Constant columns (std == 0 or only 0/1 value) are set to 0 for all rows (avoids division by zero).
- Nulls are preserved.

Cargo.toml snippet (add to your project):
